{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A jump-action game where you control Hololive members and aim for the goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All platform objects are based on Hololive members\u2019 episodes \u2014 over 250 in total!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the gliding action with mascot balloons skillfully to reach the goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes a massive main stage and short stages for each generation. Updates will continually add new stages and objects based on the latest episodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The free version lets you play through the entire long main stage including the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b To unlock the features restricted in the free version, you need to purchase the \u201cStandard Edition Upgrade DLC.\u201d The options available in the free version are as follows.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selectable Holomem: Pekora Usada, Moona Hoshinova, Shion\u00a0Murasaki </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selectable mascot balloons: Nousagi, Moonabito, Shiokko</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selectable stage: Main Stage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selectable difficulty: Normal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b The 3D models of Holomen are official models used with permission. In the Standard Edition Upgrade DLC, you can select a total of 35 player characters, mainly JP talents. For other details and added features, please refer to the \u201cStandard Edition Upgrade DLC.\u201d</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Stage Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Usada Construction duo \u2014 <strong>Pekora Usada</strong> and <strong>Moona Hoshinova</strong> \u2014 had planned an off-collaboration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Moona was taking too long to arrive, a flustered Pekora decided to go all the way to the moon to fetch her!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the under-construction <i>New Pekora Tower</i>, serving as an orbital elevator, to reach the moon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hurry, Peko-chan! Go pick up Moona before the stream starts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rabbit can only leap toward the moon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971290/extras/keyvisual.jpg?t=1766072578\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect \u201cMemories\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By obtaining items, you can unlock the gallery and learn the stories behind the platform objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the time you\u2019ve climbed to the top, you\u2019ll be a Hololive expert!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971290/extras/396e13dbebdc022bb463d3bd2d9a51a2.avif?t=1766072578\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971290/extras/0d526a9b84d6a9999c8de9a4c402046c.avif?t=1766072578\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make the Most of</strong>\u00a0<strong>Mascot Balloons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By obtaining mascot balloons placed throughout the stage, you\u2019ll be able to use the gliding action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gliding can be used both for progression and to prevent falling, but the number of balloons is limited \u2014 timing is everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971290/extras/a3fedd0bc6610ceb1fc9eed6bbacaa1d.avif?t=1766072578\" width=1600 height=899 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971290/extras/55cf9a07f6289445cd3abbc879c3e193.avif?t=1766072578\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ranking</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with players around the world for the fastest clear time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are countless route combinations \u2014 find the one that works best for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is published under CCMC Corp(\u203b1)'s Indie game brand &quot;holo Indie&quot;.(\u203b2)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is allowed to be monetized under the examination and terms of &quot;holo Indie&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that any monetized derivative work games that include Cover Corp.'s content outside of holo Indie is not covered by these terms and is not allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b1. About CCMC Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CCMC Corp. is entrusted with website management (ex: Steam) including, examination, publishing and other necessary tasks by Cover Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b2. About &quot;holo Indie&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >holo Indie's objective is to cooperate with hololive production fans and creators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a game brand that offers &quot;Game Creator Support Program&quot; for the derivative work games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For more details about &quot;holo Indie&quot;, Please refer to the Cover Corp.'s &quot;Derivative work guidelines&quot;.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Collector Lv.1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommun